  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile setting achieve the highest accuracy (0.6529). This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder (a strong image backbone) using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, which isolates the effect of multimodal fusion. It balances exploitation (using proven RNA encoder) with exploration (adding image modality) to determine if multimodal approaches can surpass the current RNA-only best."
